                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>Department of State Press Release No. 391 of July 19, 1954, contained the text of
                    a letter from Pierre Mendès-France, the Prime Minister of France, to the
                    Secretary of State expressing appreciation for the recently completed airlift by
                    the United States of 500 French wounded from Indochina to France. For text, see
                    Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, August 2, 1954, page
                    165.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
